      "id": "warm_1746152400000_cap_01",
      "type": "technical_pattern",
      "title": "【L2】三层记忆架构：ColdMemory + WarmIndex + MemoryReviewer",
      "summary": "我有完整的 Phase E 记忆系统：ColdMemory(SQLite持久化，对话+工具操作，365天留存) + WarmIndex(JSON索引，max500条，按重要性裁剪，session间加载) + MemoryReviewer(5min自动整理，20操作阈值触发)。API: GET /api/memory/{stats,conversations,operations,warm,warm/search,warm/context} + POST /api/memory/warm/add + POST /api/memory/review。",
