    {
      "id": "warm_1777664508764_tggcsi",
      "type": "technical_pattern",
      "title": "[EB-007][L1] DeepSeek function calling 工具名必须用下划线",
      "summary": "DeepSeek 在 function calling 中自然地使用下划线命名（write_file/read_file）。工具定义名必须用下划线，不要用连字符，否则模型输出时找不到工具报 Unknown tool。在 endpointMap 中添加下划线别名作为双重保障。影响所有工具定义。",
      "tags": [
        "eb-007",
        "fix",
        "function-calling",
        "tool-naming",
        "deepseek"
      ],
      "source": "workbuddy-fix-review",
      "importance": 0.88,
      "created_at": "2026-05-01T19:41:48.764Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-05-01T19:41:48.764Z"
    },
